      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so i tried to use a snake but it felt like i hit something hard and then it just slid right past. it was such a weird sensation, like it caught on something and then released. plus the smell got even worse right when it happened, like old wet hair or something. i'm honestly starting to get a bit creeped out by it, it feels like there's something hiding in the dark part of the pipes just waiting to pop back up. is there anything that actually causes stuff to shift around like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
